---

<div class="investor-cta">
  <h3 class="investor-cta__heading">Following this as an investor?</h3>
  <p class="investor-cta__body">
    Human composting is not legal in England and Wales yet, but the market around it is forming.
    See what Terramation UK has been building ahead of it.
  </p>
  <a
    href="/investors/"
    class="btn btn--earth investor-cta__btn"
    data-investor-cta-btn
  >
    For investors
  </a>
</div>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll("[data-investor-cta-btn]").forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener("click", () => {
      window.sa_event?.("investor_cta_click");
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .investor-cta {
    background: var(--color-linen, #f5f0e8);
    border: 1px solid rgba(122, 92, 58, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-10);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-8);
  }

  .investor-cta__heading {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    color: var(--color-soil);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-3);
  }

  .investor-cta__body {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-mid);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-block-end: var(--space-6);
  }

  .investor-cta__btn {
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
</style>
